{"id":"2011748690965070712","kind":"article","title":"你能够直面现实","author":"Eliezer Yudkowsky","original_authors":["Eliezer Yudkowsky"],"original_source_urls":["https://www.readthesequences.com/You-Can-Face-Reality"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"理性 & 克服偏见","date":"2026-03-02","updated":"2026-07-22","votes":66,"comment_count":4,"minutes":1,"chars":274,"keywords":["现实接纳","尤金·简德林","自我反思"],"summary":"译文引用尤金·简德林，劝人承认现实并与之互动：回避不会令现实消失，而人能够面对现实，正因为早已承受着它。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2011748690965070712","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<blockquote data-pid=\"8roqoevh\"> 现实已然如此。<br/> 承认它不会变得更糟。<br/> 避而不谈也不会使其消失。<br/> 正因为它是真实的，它才是你能与之互动的存在。<br/> 任何虚假之物，都无法构筑真实的生活。<br/> 人们能够承受现实，<br/> 因为他们早已身受其重。<br/> ——<b>尤金·简德林（Eugene Gendlin）</b></blockquote><p class=\"ztext-empty-paragraph\"><br/></p><hr/><p data-pid=\"aoY-3rjw\">总目录：</p><a class=\"internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录\" href=\"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/2056344770390373406\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">《理性：从人工智能到僵尸》导读与目录</a><p data-pid=\"RelX7XvO\">卷：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"第二卷：如何真正改变你的想法\" data-tm-id=\"2015489803068651120\" href=\"#/post/2015489803068651120\">第二卷：如何真正改变你的想法</a><p data-pid=\"0Q7arB35\">章节：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"放手\" data-tm-id=\"2015473376601327376\" href=\"#/post/2015473376601327376\">放手</a><p data-pid=\"2X6zGDtG\">上一篇：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/v2-568379c4de8c6dd358d47802e1b0bcbb.jpg?source=7e7ef6e2&amp;needBackground=1\" data-draft-title=\"怀疑的正确用法\" data-tm-id=\"2011104623788836422\" href=\"#/post/2011104623788836422\">怀疑的正确用法</a><p data-pid=\"y-u9itdS\">下一篇：</p><a class=\"internal tm-internal\" data-draft-cover=\"\" data-draft-title=\"关于好奇心的冥想\" data-tm-id=\"2012214916648546322\" href=\"#/post/2012214916648546322\">关于好奇心的冥想</a><hr/><blockquote data-pid=\"MI44KKhv\